extends layout

block content
    .error_container
        h1
            div 404 Error
            | Oops! Page Not Found
        div What to Do:
        ol
            li
                strong Double-check the URL:
                |  Ensure that the URL you entered is correct. Verify for any typographical errors and make sure it matches the intended web address.
            li
                strong Go to the Home Page:
                |  You can return to the website's home page by clicking on the logo or using the navigation menu.
            li
                strong Report the Issue:
                |  If you believe there is a problem with the website or the link you followed, consider reporting it to the website administrator.
        p We apologize for any inconvenience this may have caused. If you continue to encounter this error, please contact our support team for further assistance.
        button
            a(href= 'mailto:letsunderstandconcepts@gmail.com?subject=Reporting%20an%20Error%20on%20the%20Website') Report Error